
# Project 3: Excel Pivot Analysis & What-If Analysis

## Project Overview
This project focuses on advanced Excel data management, PivotTables, and What-If Analysis techniques to analyze business sales data and generate meaningful insights.

## Project Objectives
- Organize and manage raw sales data.
- Create and customize PivotTables.
- Analyze sales by region and product.
- Use Goal Seek to achieve sales targets.
- Create scenarios using Scenario Manager.
- Apply calculated fields and calculated items.
- Group, sort, and filter PivotTable data.
- Use slicers for interactive reporting.
- Generate summaries using the PIVOTBY function.

## Workbook Structure

| Worksheet | Description |
|---|---|
| Sales Raw Data | Main sales dataset |
| Pivot Report | PivotTable sales analysis |
| Goal Seek Result | Goal Seek calculations and results |
| Scenario Summary | Scenario Manager summary report |

